{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28631","headline":"贺崔大夫崔正字 · 杜牧","name":"贺崔大夫崔正字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"内举无惭古所难，燕台遥想拂尘冠。\n登龙有路水不峻，一鴈背飞天正寒。\n别夜酒余红烛短，映山帆满碧霞残。\n谢公楼下潺湲响，离恨诗情添几般。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28631.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28631","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}